This file marks the Praxis BASELINE repository (the template itself), not a product project.

Effect: scripts/check_release_gate.py skips the release gate when this file is present, so the
baseline can be tagged/released without satisfying product testing/security/deployment gates.

IMPORTANT: real projects must NOT contain this file. `bootstrap.sh init` deliberately does not copy it,
so projects created from this baseline get the full, enforced release gate.
